  "description": "Inputs for the RFC 8785 ES6 number serialisation test. Generate IEEE-754 doubles with the algorithm below, serialise each, write 'hex-ieee,expected\n' lines (hex without leading zeros), and compare the SHA-256 of the first N lines with 'checksums'. Source: the testdata README of the RFC 8785 reference implementation (github.com/cyberphone/json-canonicalization, Apache-2.0).",
